// QUIC loss detection and congestion control, RFC 9002:
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9002
//
// The round-trip estimate of §5, the packet and time loss thresholds of §6.1, the probe
// timeout of §6.2, NewReno and the recovery period of §7, and persistent congestion.
//
// It holds no clock: every entry point takes `now` in microseconds, so a test drives it
// with whatever times it likes and a connection drives it with the real one.
import {
  "moonbitstack/moonquic/frame",
}
